{"step_index":514,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T03:24:49Z","thinking":"The initial step is to identify publishing, media, and advertising companies in Busan. I'll filter the CSV data focusing on businesses within the \"publishing/advertising/knowledge information\" sectors, prioritizing larger firms. Next, a script will be used to target companies with missing revenue data, specifically those from previous investigations (2024/2025) or those associated with relevant keywords.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nfunction parseFullCSV(content) {\n  const rows = [];\n  let currentRow = [];\n  let currentField = '';\n  let inQuotes = false;\n  for (let i = 0; i < content.length; i++) {\n    const char = content[i];\n    const nextChar = content[i + 1];\n    if (char === '\"') {\n      if (inQuotes && nextChar === '\"') {\n        currentField += '\"';\n        i++;\n      } else {\n        inQuotes = !inQuotes;\n      }\n    } else if (char === ',' && !inQuotes) {\n      currentRow.push(currentField);\n      currentField = '';\n    } else if ((char === '\\r' || char === '\\n') && !inQuotes) {\n      if (char === '\\r' && nextChar === '\\n') i++;\n      currentRow.push(currentField);\n      if (currentRow.some(f => f.trim() !== '')) rows.push(currentRow);\n      currentRow = [];\n      currentField = '';\n    } else {\n      currentField += char;\n    }\n  }\n  if (currentField !== '' || currentRow.length > 0) {\n    currentRow.push(currentField);\n    if (currentRow.some(f => f.trim() !== '')) rows.push(currentRow);\n  }\n  return rows;\n}\n\nconst csvPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today/(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명.csv';\nconst content = fs.readFileSync(csvPath, 'utf8');\nconst rows = parseFullCSV(content);\nconst data = rows.slice(1);\n\n// Look at rows 300 to 1000\nconst corps = data.filter((r, idx) => {\n  const seq = parseInt(r[1], 10);\n  const name = r[2] ? r[2].trim() : '';\n  const biz = r[3] ? r[3].trim() : '';\n  const s24 = r[16] ? r[16].trim() : '';\n  const s25 = r[17] ? r[17].trim() : '';\n  return seq >= 300 && seq <= 1200 && (name.includes('주식회사') || name.includes('(주)') || name.includes('㈜')) && biz !== '' && !s24 && !s25;\n});\n\nconsole.log('Corps between Seq 300 and 1200 without sales:', corps.length);\ncorps.slice(0, 30).forEach(c => {\n  console.log(`[Seq ${c[1]}] ${c[2]} | Biz: ${c[3]} | Cat: ${c[11]} | CEO: ${c[6]}`);\n});\n","Description":"Find corps between Seq 300 and 1200 missing sales","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a97462f9-3976-4927-b799-281f20134eb3\\scratch\\find_corps_300_1200.js","toolAction":"Writing find corps script","toolSummary":"Create find_corps_300_1200.js"}}]}
